# Local-only working folders. Each states its own intent in an AGENTS.md or
# header; the rules below are what enforce it.

# Product content produced by the release-post skill. articles/AGENTS.md declares
# this folder gitignored and never committed to the spectacular repo.
articles/

# Research artifacts: saved NotebookLM queries, agent-memory reports, source
# dumps. Inputs to thinking, not product surface; regenerable and unversioned.
_research/

# Canonical snapshots are local recovery artifacts only. They duplicate what git
# history already holds, so nothing here travels with a review or a release. If a
# snapshot is ever needed as evidence, export it deliberately rather than
# force-adding this folder.
_snapshots/

# Local editor and plugin state, per-machine. Shared project settings belong in
# a tracked file, not this one.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Local working files. TODO.md holds deferred decisions and FEEDBACKS.md holds
# captured review notes; both are scratch for the owner, not product content.
# Governance records that cite them quote what they need, because the file is
# not published alongside the record.
TODO.md
FEEDBACKS.md

# Unstructured thinking: the sketchpad stage before an idea earns an Atlas
# snippet. No schema, no naming rules, no entity — and skip-listed in discovery
# so a stray note can never refuse a command. Nothing in the repository cites it.
.spectacular/raw/

# Local-only: backups, snapshots, scratch — never committed
_local/
